the resolved taxonomy `identifier_schemes.a_id.pattern`: identifier integrity: and `identifier_schemes.b_id.pattern` admit one string, so two records could carry one identifier. `a_id` is in namespace `Q-R`, and kinds `leaf1`, `grandchild` mint under it. `b_id` is in namespace `Q`, and kinds `leaf2`, `leaf3` mint under it
